h1. Synopsis

	${project.name}

	${project.description}

	Maven URL:
		[mvn:${project.groupId}/${project.artifactId}/${project.version}]

h1. Description

	This bundle embeds Apache Tomcat to provide a web container. It deploys the servlets, filters, listeners,
	resources and servlet context helpers registered as services following the OSGi Servlet Whiteboard
	specification, and the Web Application Bundles (bundles with a Web-ContextPath header).

	The web container is configured in the etc/org.apache.karaf.services.web.cfg file.

